The protocol definitions in proto/ and the envd API description in
crates/envd/reference/ are copied from E2B; the commit each copy comes from is
recorded in the UPSTREAM_COMMIT file next to it. The Rust code reimplements the
behaviour of E2B's envd and orchestrator; it is not a line by line translation.

